<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">OGA - ELOYI TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">Ogalatiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ogalatiya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ogalatiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ogalatiya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kwupu Ungwu Ɔpɔlu A Ka Laa Enzu Umba OGALATIYA</para>
  <para style="imt1">Kambu Iyemo</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔpɔlu a ka kwupu kwɔlɛ laa Ɛshɔshi iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu Oromu mu ɛzhi iyi Ogalatiya. Tabɔkɔ iso iyeshi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi i le mu ifulama munamuna akwɛyi enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo na yi tete, akwɛyi kwuyo kwu wɔ tee: akwu mega tee Umbwalu shɛ a mbwalu Ɛrama iyi Omosisi dɛ gba a fya isama le? Ɔpɔlu ba e so mbo kpeke-e tee ɛlɛ akwu mega mo, ikwidufulo mu Okrasi kɛɛkyi gba i shi onzu ototo mbaa Ukpo le. Wazɔ ɛzu iyi angba umba bɔkɔ o ya mba tee Azhudayiza awu ba o yi mu ɛshɔshi ɛlɛ egbo igɔma raa. Enzu mbɔlɛ o yi mu enzu izɔma tee Wambwalu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo awu, mɛga ɔ mbwalu Ɛrama iyi Omosisi iyi ɛsɔ izema mbala kiya ingyirimo mbala edumudumu iyi Azhu dɛɛ gba ɔ fya ototo ma mbaa Ukpo le. O kyo ɔ za laa enzu tee onzu uwunawuna le shi alu mbaa iso iyi Ɔpɔlu mo, moo akwu Ukpo gba a lɔ Ɔpɔlu ma le mo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu kwupu kwɔlɛ, Ɔpɔlu a zɔ enzu umba Ogalatiya iso iyeshi iyi bɔkɔ e yi mu anitama yi akwɛyi a za mba tee Ukpo gba a lɔ wu le. Ɔpɔlu a za mba tee ekpasu iyi ɛduma ɛlɛ iwomo, i ngyi mbaa Ukpo moo akwu mbaa onzu mo. Ukpo a ŋa wu te kaa la zilɔ laa enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo tete. Ɔpɔlu e kyo a za mba tee ɛrama imbwaluma i do tee i gbɔ ingbomo iyi onzu ma mo; ikwidufulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi kɛɛkyi gba i shi onzu ototo mbaa Ukpo le. Akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu a mbwa yi tee idɛnyi iyi ki yi yi gba i zɔ tee ki yi ikwidufulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi le, moo akwu ɛrama imbwaluma mo. Ifate wa mbwalu lɔ zɛ luze undu Kwundu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iso Iyi I Yi mɛmi</para>
  <para style="io">Kambu iyemo (1:1-10)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ukpo e shi Ɔpɔlu ekpasu (1:11-2:21)</para>
  <para style="io1">Esheshi iyi Ukpo (3:1-4:31)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛza iyeshi i yi mu ɛduma iwomo (5:1-6:16)</para>
  <para style="io1">Imbwama iyi iso (6:17,18)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Imi Ɔpɔlu, mi kwu uzilɔ uwu bɔkɔ Ada Ɔsu Ukpo mbala Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi uwu bɔkɔ e kpomo, Ukpo ba e yi wu mo mu kwuvɔ awu, gba o ŋa mi le, akwu onzu uwu inyi igyi gba a ŋa mi le mo. <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />Ɛmɛnɛ lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o yi mbala mi, o nyama te la mi kakwupu kwɔlɛ ka lɔ ka yi, lunyi lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ lu mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi mu ɛzhi iyi Ogalatiya.<verse eid="GAL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Ete nzu Ada Ɔsu Ukpo mbala Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi lo shi yi esheshi wu mbala idigbomo. <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />A kwu mi nyama iyi Ada Ɔsu Ukpo gba Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi a ra la kwunyɔ wu e shi le kwuwongu ingbomo nzu ka la sa nzu ma mu ira iyi ɔyi ɔlɛ. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Iduma lakwu iyi Ada Ɔsu Ukpo iyɔkpɔɔ ba ɔkpɔɔ. Ami.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilɔ Iyesheshi Akwu Ikpɛnyi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />I shi mi kenzu iyama te lunyi lu yi mu ɔgwuzɛ ongbulolo uwu Ukpo, uwu bɔkɔ a ya yi ma mu esheshi iyi Okrasi ilafyima. Lu yi mu ɔgwuzɛ owa <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />uwu bɔkɔ akwu iso iyi Ukpo mo ndii imbwaluma. I zɔ pepee te enzu umbafo o ye yi mu egbo iwo ngɛrɛngɛrɛ ka lo tutu iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi mo. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Gba onzu uwunawuna, la kinzu, la ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo, a wɔ a ta yi anu iyi rɛnu ingyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi ingyi ri ŋangama mbala ingyi ki so yi dɛ-ɛ awu, Ukpo la ka wu ingyira. <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Kyamate ki so-o awu, mi gba mi so kpɔ, te: Gba onzu uwunawuna a gba a ta yi anu iyi rɛnu ingyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi ingyi ri ŋangama mbala ingyi lu na awu, onzu awu Ukpo la ta wu mu ɔyi uwu ɔkpɔɔ ba ɔkpɔɔ!<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Iso iyi mi so le, mi so te ka enzu lo pwɔ mi ma le nana Ukpo ŋa? Na lu ma te mi wo te ka la mi shela enzu mi le ŋa? Lo zɔ te ipwɔma iyi enzu gba mi gyi le, mi kwu umɛgba uwu Okrasi mo.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iyi I Wo Bɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu Akwu U zɛ ilɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, mi gyite la lu yitu te iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi iyi bɔkɔ mi ta yi anu yi awu, akwu mbaa onzu gba i wɔ le mo. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi mafyi wu gba a zɔ mi ɛlɔgbulɔ ɛnyi mu ɛbɛ imama akwɛyi e shi mi yi le, mo akwu onzu uwu inyi igyi mo.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Lunyi lu pwa eza iyi luzɛ mi mekyi kwuyengwu bɔkɔ mi lɛ Ukpo kyamate Azhu o lɛ awu. Mi lo enzu umba Ukpo inyashi gyɔɔ, mi gyite la mi ngbɛ mba ma lɛɛbi ka lo pwa ɛnyi mba fo. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Imi mi ka egwu mi lɛɛbi ekpasu ma mu ɛrama iyi Omosisi mbala ukwu uwu umba asɔkwu mi imbwaluma.<verse eid="GAL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Ukpo ba a ŋa mi ngbaa te bɔkɔ mi yi mu ubwu uwu ɛnɛ mi le. Uwu a zɔ mi esheshi wu akwɛyi a ya mi ma, <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />akwɛyi a zɔ mi umɛ wu, Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi te la mi kwu ɔlɔgbulɔ wu mba enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo. Tabɔkɔ ɛlɛ iwo, akwɛyi mi ka mba onzu uwunawuna te la zɔ mi iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi mo. <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />Wa zɛ ilɔ mu ɔzhɛrusalɛ umba bɔkɔ Ukpo a ya mba ma keyi la mi, lala mi ka ka la mi ma mba dɛ mo akwɛyi mi kama iyami mu kusɛ ungwu Arabiya dɛ ishi mi bi gbama mu kwuse ungwu Ɔdamasikɔ le. <verse eid="GAL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Akwɛyi mizhikembo iyi lɔri lola, mi ka mu ɔzhɛrusalɛ ka la mi ma Opita akwɛyi mi ŋɔ mbala wu nzhi ba afyi uwo la ɛlɔ. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Imi ba mi ma ozhemisi, umanyiwu Ɔzhizɔsi kɛɛkyi bi, wa zɛ ilɔ umbafo mbamba, mi ma mba mo.<verse eid="GAL 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Apula iyi mi ka yi ele lɛɛbi akwu ongbulolo, Ukpo e yitu te ɛlɛ akwu imwilo mo.<verse eid="GAL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ mi ka mu ɛzhi iyi Osiriya mbala Osilisiya. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Kwuye kwɔngu ba wa mbwalu Okrasi mu Ozhudiya o do yitu mye mo. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Umba o pwa eza iyami bi, mba enzu te, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e lo nzu inyashi gyɔɔ awu, kekelele akwu u tanu iyi rɛnu ingyi ikwu idu fulo mu Ukpo ingyi bɔkɔ mekyi, a gyite la ngbɛ ngyi ma awu ŋa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Akwɛyi o du Ukpo ma kwuwo mi.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s">Ɔpɔlu Mbala Wa zɛ ilɔ Umba O Shimo Awu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />mizhikembo iyi lɔri luwo la londo, Imi mbala Obanaba ki gba ki bo mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, mi to Ɔtayitɔ a zɛ mbala nzu tete. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Mi ka kyamate bɔkɔ o zɔ mi mu ɛbɛ awu, mi ka te la mi zɛ mba ilɔ iyi Ukpo iyi bɔkɔ mi yi mu izɛma la enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo le. Imi ba mi so yi la enzumbakɔ kyokyo, mo mi gyi te la mi wo ɛduma shaa mo. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Ɔtayitɔ uwu bɔkɔ e yi mbala mi bɔkɔ akwu onzu uwu Azhu mo lala o kpa wu mɛga te la zɛ ɛsɔ ma mo. <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Iso ɛlɛ i bo kwuwongu ɛmɛnɛ umba angba umba bɔkɔ o fye wɛrɛrɛ te lo wo nzu ewo meyi mekeka iyi iwɔ ma iyi bɔkɔ Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi a wanzu ma le, o gyi te kaa lo ra nzu lo wo enye. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Kinzu ba ki shi mbo kapa bwɛ te mo, kwuwongu ki gyi te ongbulolo uwu ilɔ iyesheshi iyi Ukpo ka li yi mbala yi.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o yese ɛmba te umba gba o ka le awu, ingyi bɔkɔ umba o kwu awu, akwa mi kiya mo, mo Ukpo e yese kwudu gba a zɔ ombu le mo, Enzu mbamba ba o do te o kyo kiya kinyinyi mu ilɔ mi mo. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Ukpo ba e to ɛduma iyi anu itama e shi mi, kaa la mi tanu la enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo kyamate bɔkɔ e shi Opita kaa la tanu la Azhu tayi. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Moo Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e shi Opita ekpasu kaa le wo ɛduma iyi onzu u zɛ ilɔ la Azhu awu, gba e shi mi le tete kaa la mi wo ɛduma iyi onzu uzilɔ la umba bɔkɔ o kwu Azhu mo . <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Ozhemisi, Opita mbala,Ɔzhɔnu umba bɔkɔ o yitu mbo te umba gba akwu wa to keyi umba igyirima le awu, o zɔngɔma ma te Ukpo e to ɛduma ɛlɛ e shi mi, akwɛyi o na mi mbala Obanaba ma, o nyama te kinzu la ki so mbaa enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo, umba ba lo so mba Azhu. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Iyi bɔkɔ o so gba akwu te, la ki lolo ayirewa umba bɔkɔ o yi meka mba, ɛlɛ gba iyi mu egbo mi iyɔkpɔɔ te la mi wo le.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔpɔlu E Tu Opita mo Mu Atiyɔki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Opita e bo mu Atiyɔki, mi so wu leyi wu te e wo ɔnyɛ mo . <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Opita e koko e ri kiya mbala enzu mba bɔkɔ o kwu Azhu mo dɛ, ta bɔkɔ enzu umbafo ɔ wɔ mba Ozhemisi o bo ŋa, akwɛyi e turu a gba kembo, a zɛ kɛmɛ e shi mbo kwuwongu a riyi iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o nyama laa ɛsɔ izɛma. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Azhu umba bɔkɔ o yɔmɔ o kyo mu kwukyoro kwɔngwu, kwukyoro mbo kwɔngwu kwu shi Obanaba a tama tete. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Tabɔkɔ mi mate te iwomo mbo i zɛ kya mbala ongbulolo uwu ilɔ iyesheshi ɛlɛ mo, akwɛyi mi za la Opita la eyi iyi enzu lɛɛbi te, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ ŋɔ kwu Azhu ɔbulɛ ŋɔ wo mate onzu uwu bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo. I wo te bɔkɔ enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo ŋɔ kpa mba mɛga te lo mbwalu ukwu uwu Azhu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Azhu Mbala Umba Bɔkɔ Akwu Azhu mo O Samba ma Kwuwongwu Ikwidufulo mbo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />&lt;&lt;Uŋɔ mbala mi o mba nzu ki kwu Azhu, ki kwu umba bɔkɔ akwu &lt;Azhu mo, bɔkɔ o ya mba te enzu umba ingbomo awu mo&gt; <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Kinzu ki yitu te ikwu idu fulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi kɛɛkyi gba onzu aa fya inama mbaa Ukpo le, mo akwu ɛrama iyi Omosisi imbwaluma mo. Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ kinzu tete ki kwu idu ki fulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi kaa la ki fya inama mbaa Ukpo, mo akwu mu ɛrama imbwalu ma mo, mo onzu uwu bɔkɔ Ukpo e to ombu a sha wu kwuwongu ɛrama iyi Omosisi imbwalu ma e yi mo . <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Akwiyi gba ki wo te kaa la ki fya inama mbaa Ukpo meka iyi Okrasi akwɛyi o gba o du nzu te ki kwu enzu umba ingbomo kyamate umba bɔkɔ o kwu Azhu mo, ɛlɛ i zɔ te Okrasi e kyo ingbomo mo re? akwu tayi mo ndii. <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Gba kiya ingyi bɔkɔ Imi gba mi shiri gyi mo le, akwɛyi mi gba ngyi la imbomo debate mi kwu u fo ɛrama ma . <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Meka iyi ɛrama iyi Omosisi mi yi kyamate ukpɛzhi uwu onzu tayi uwu bɔkɔ ɛrama i yi ekpasu mawu fo, kaka la mi yi kwunyɔ kaa mi wo ɛduma la Ukpo. <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />Mi kpomo mbala Okrasi mu kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu oo, akwu Imi gba mi yi lareyi le fo Okrasi gba e yi lareyi ma mi le ŋa. I yi lareyi mi, mi kwu idu mi fulo mu umɛ uwu Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e pwu idɛnyi mi akwɛyi e kpomo kwuwo mi awu. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Imi mi towo esheshi iyi Ukpo ma mo, mo akwiyi gba onzu aa fya ototo uwu Ukpo mu ɛrama iyi Omosisi imbwaluma, debate Okrasi e kpomo shaa!<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s">Imbwalu Ɛrama Iyi Omosisi Nana Ikwidufulo Mu Okrasi Ŋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Lunyi enzu umba Ogalatiya erendo mbɔlɛ! Lu wo la ba lu nyama enzu o kyoro yi mo te? Lunyi umba bɔkɔ o ba yi eza marimari iyi lukwu undu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi mu kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu! <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Mi gyi te la mi yo yi kwuyo kwukpɛnyi kwɔlɛ: Bɔkɔ lu na Kwundu uwu Ukpo awu akwu mu Ɛrama iyi Omosisi imbwaluma naa akwu mu inyama yi mu iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi ŋa? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Lalu kwu erendo mo nɛ! Lunyi umba bɔkɔ lu na Kwundu uwu Ukpo; kekelele lu gyi te la lu mbwa luzɛ yi ma mu ekpasu yi re? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Lalu nyama te inyashi iyi lu ma le lakwu iyi umbwa mo, mo imi mi shi egbo te inyashi ɛlɛ akwu iyeshi! <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Tabɔkɔ Ukpo e shi yi kwundu wu te le wo ɛduma iyi amɛ mekeka yi awu akwu kwuwongu ɛrama iyi Omosisi imbwaluma naa akwu kwuwongu ikwu idu fulo yi mu iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi ŋa?<verse eid="GAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu so te, &lt;&lt;Aburamu e kwu idu e fulo mu Ukpo, akwɛyi Ukpo a ya wu te onzu ototo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Lunyi la lu yitu te, enzu umba bɔkɔ o kwidu o fulo mu Ukpo gba akwu ɛmɛ umba Aburamu le. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />O ka mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo te, Ukpo a ma keyi mekekyi te Ukpo e shi enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo te lo kwu enzu umba ototo kwuwongu ikwu idu fulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi. Akwɛyi kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu tanu iyi ilɔ iyesheshi la Aburamu te: &lt;&lt;I zɛ ma ŋa gba Ukpo e shi enzu lɛɛbi esheshi le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, enzu umba bɔkɔ o kwidu o fulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi, umba o ma esheshi kyaa mbala Aburamu uwu bɔkɔ a kwidu e fulo awu.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o gyikpɔɔ te lo mbwalu ɛrama iyi Omosisi, Ukpo e lo mbo inyashi, moo kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a mbwalu ɛrama iyi Omosisi lɛɛbi mo, Ukpo e lo wu inyashi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GAL 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Ɛlɛ i zɔ pepee te, Ukpo aa ma ɔsɛkɛnɛ uwu onzu mu ɛrama iyi Omosisi imbwaluma mo, moo kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Onzu ototo uwu bɔkɔ e kwidu e fulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi gba e yi kwunyɔ le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Ikwidufulo mu Ukpo i yi kya mbala ɛrama iyi Omosisi imbwaluma mo, kyamate bɔkɔ kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a mbwalu ɛrama iyi Omosisi lɛɛbi, onzu awu tayi gba ee yi kwunyɔ le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GAL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi a wa nzu ma mu inyashi iyi bɔkɔ i fa te Ukpo e lo enzu umba bɔkɔ o lomo la ɛrama iyi Omosisi mo, akwɛyi a na lukwu nzu e kpomo, moo ɛrama iyi Omosisi i zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwu bɔkɔ o bɔ wu iba mu kwuwɛyi, i zɔ te onzu awu Ukpo a ta wu kenzu ungira.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Okrasi e wo ɛlɛ te kaa wa mbwalu wu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo lo kyo lo fya esheshi iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a zɔ te ee wo la Aburamu awu, kaa la ki fya Kwundu uwu Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ Ukpo e so te ee shi nzu awu kwuwongu idu kwufulo nzu mu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛrama Iyi Omosisi Mbala Kenzu Igyirima Unga Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, mi gyi te la mi zɔ yi kiya ingyifo ingyi lu yitu ngyi ee kaa la lu zɔngɔma iso iyi bɔkɔ mi ye yi mu isomo ele marimari: Gba enzu wepo o nyama o siso o shi mɛzhi, onzu uwu e domo te e shiriyimo naa e kyo kiya mu kadu e yi mo. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Ukpo e siso te ee wo ɛlɛ la Aburamu mbala umɛ wu. Kwokpo ungwu Ukpo ku zɔ te Ukpo ee wo ɛlɛ &lt;&lt;La ɛmɛ wu mo&gt;&gt;, Kwu zɔ te Ukpo ee wo ɛlɛ, &lt;&lt;Laa umɛ wu,&gt;&gt; iso ɛlɛ o so mu reshi ingyi onzu ɛnyi kɛɛkyi, onzu ele gba akwu Okrasi le. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Iluma iyi iso iyi bɔkɔ mi so awu gba iyi te: Ukpo e siso e shi mɛzhi mbala Aburamu ba a zɔ te ee wo ɛduma ma yi. Ɛrama iyi Omosisi iyi bɔkɔ o bo yi mizhikembo iyi lɔri e deri endo la lɔri uwekpela awu, ɛrama ɛnyi i do iso iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e so e shi mɛzhi mbala Aburamu awu ishirimo mo. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Mo Ukpo e wo esheshi la enzu kwuwongu o mbwalu ɛrama iyi Omosisi le mo, uwu e shi mbo esheshi wu kwuwongu bɔkɔ a zɔ te ee wo yi tayi le. <verse eid="GAL 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Kwuwongwu kwuwongumbe ba Ukpo e shi ɛrama iyi Omosisi? Ukpo e kyo yi kadu kaa enzu lo zɔngɔma ingbomo mba ma dɛshi Okrasi umɛ uwu Aburamu le bo, uwu bɔkɔ Ukpo e so e shi mɛzhi mbala wu. E shi alɔgbulɔ wu Ɛrama ɛlɛ te, onzu uwufo le yi kyamate onzu uwu kwudeka mba. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Gba rɛnu li ta lo onzu ukpɛnyi a kagyi onzu uwu kwudeka shaa fo; kwuwongu Ukpo akwu ukpɛnyi.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwuyi Ungwu Kwu Shi O Shi Ɛrama Iyi Omosisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Kekelele, i zɔ te ɛrama iyi Omosisi ɛlɛ i nyama la rɛshi ingyi Ukpo mo re? Akwu tayi mo!Ɛrama iyi Omosisi i domo te i shi kwunyɔ mo. Gba li do kwunyɔ ishimo, de ba Ukpo a ba sa uwewe mo mu ɛrama. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Kwokpo ungwu Ukpo ba kwu zɔ te kpɛkpɛ nzu ki kwu enye umba ingbomo; ɛlɛ i wo te kaa iso iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e so te e wo awu, e wo rɛshi ngyɛngyi la enzu umba bɔkɔ o kwidu o fulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. <verse eid="GAL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Keyi dɛ kaakwuyengwu ikwu idu lu fulo lakwu bo, ɛrama iyi Omosisi i ta nzu kwɔshi kpɛ mu ugu ugyi, nzhii ba kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a ba wa nzu ma. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Ɛrama iyi Omosisi i yi kyamate onzu uwu bɔkɔ a bɔ nzu eyi nzhii ba ibomo iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, ɛlɛ i wo te kaa la ki yi ɔsɛkɛnɛ mu idu iyi Ukpo kwuwongu ikwu idu fulo nzu mu Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Kekelele kwuyengwu ikwu idu lu fulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi kwu bo-o, ɛrama iyi Omosisi i yi ekpasu meka nzu fo.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛmɛ Umba Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Lunyi lɛɛbi lu kwu ɛmɛ umba Ukpo kwuwongu ikwu idu fulo yi mu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi, <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />mo lunyi lɛɛbi yi umba bɔkɔ o wo yi obatisima awu lu kwu wakpɛnyi mbala Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi akwɛyi lu yi kyamate Okrasi bi ŋa. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Kekelele, kwusɛ kwu yi meka iyi Azhu mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo fo, naa unye mbala onzu uwu bɔkɔ akwu unye mo, naa ɔnzɔnu mbala okokpayi mo, kwuwongu lunyi lɛɛbi lu kwu wakpɛnyi mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Gba lunyi lu kwu enzu umba Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, ɛlɛ i zɔ te o kyo o wa yi te lu kwu ɛdɔ iyi Aburamu akwɛyi lu kyo lu fya ogbo uwu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e so te ee shi Aburamu awu.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Iso iyi mi yi mu isomo le gba i yi te, kwuyengwu umɛ uwu bɔkɔ e ri ogu uwu ete wu, akwu umɛshɛri bɛnɛ, e yi kyamate unye te, tetete apula iyi ete wu lɛɛbi akwu iyawu. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />kwuyengwu akwu umɛshɛri bɛnɛ, enzu gba o bɔ wu eyi mbala apula iyi ete wu le nzhii ba kwuyengwu ete wu a zɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Tatayi, kwuyengwu ki kwu ɛmɛshɛri ki kwu enye umba kwudu kwɔlɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Tabɔkɔ kwuyengwu Ukpo kwu kpo kya akwɛyi Ukpo a lɔ umɛ wu, okokpayi gba a mba wu le, umɛ awu o mba wu kwuyengwu ɛrama iyi Omosisi, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />kaa la wala enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu ɛrama ma, kwuwongu kaa la ki kwu ɛmɛ umba Ukpo. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Kwuwongwu bɔkɔ lunyi lu kwu ɛmɛ wu, akwɛyi Ukpo a lɔ kwundu ungwu umɛ wu kaa lakwu ŋɔ mu egbo nzu, Kwundu uwu umɛ wu uwu e koko a yama te, &lt;&lt;Ada, Ada.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ ŋɔ kwu unye fo, ŋɔ kwu umɛ ŋa. Tabɔkɔ Ukpo a ra ŋa e wo umɛ wu ele, uŋɔ ŋɔ kwu u ri ogu wu tete.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔpɔlu A Ta Aka Kwuwongwu Enzu Umba Ogalatiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Kwuye ungwekyi, bɔkɔ lu yi Ukpo mo awu, lu gbo rinye la eshi. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Kekelele lu yitu iyi Ukpo, Ukpo ba e yitu yi ee, kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ lu gba lu mbwalu eshi iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ? Lu gyi te la lu gba la lu gbo rinye la eshi kpɔ re? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ lu bɔ eyi mu afyi, mbala evya mbala ɔyi mbala lɔri undu o shi mu ɛrama iyi Omosisi le? <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Ubwugyi mi gba e yi te ɛduma iyi mi wo munyi yi ele a ŋa akwu shaa.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, mi kpa yi ɛshɛku te, lunyi la lu yi kyamate imi tayi, mo imi mi yi kyamate lunyi tayi tete. Lu wo mi ira ikpikpɛnyi mo. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Lunyi la lu lolo te kwuyengwu kwonze bɔkɔ mi zɛ yi ilɔ iyi Ɔzhizɔsi awu, mi yi okpara uwu ɛnwu mo. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Ofya mi u lo yi inyashi gyɔɔ, tetete lu towo mi mo mo. Lu na mi kyamate mi kwu ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo tayi, kyamate mi kwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi te. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Kimbe ki wo bɔkɔ kwuye kwɔngu lu yi ɔnyɛ ba kekelele lu yi ɔnyɛ fo le? Mi yitu te, lo zɔ te i womo, lu bu lu eyi yi ma lu bu shi mi kaa li zɔ te lu pwu idɛnyi mi. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Kwuwongwu mi so yi ongbulolo le gba mi vindɔ onzu uwoyi yi le?<verse eid="GAL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Enzu umba o yi egbo munyi yi awu, egbo mbo akwu iyeshi mo, umba o gyi te lo ka yi ma mbala mi kaa la lu mbwa mba ma. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Akwu kiya ingyi esheshi gba onzu a gyi ŋɔ, gba igyima wu akwu mu egbo iyi esheshi. Lalu koko lu wo tayi moo akwu kwuyengwu mi yi mbala yi kɛɛkyi mo. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Ɛmɛ mi mu Okrasi, i ye mi kyamate mi yi mu kwomba iwomo kwuwo yi kpɔ nzhii ba kwuyengwu bɔkɔ lu kɔma mu Okrasi. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Mu igyima mi, mi gyi te kaa mi yi mbala yi kekelele akwɛyi mi siso mbala yi mu opwu uwu oloto, moo mi yi ubwu ugyi kwuwo yi.<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aga Mbala Osera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Lalu so mi lunyi umba bɔkɔ lu gyi te la lu lomo la ɛrama ma awu, lu yitu iyi kiya ingyi ɛrama i so mo re? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Moo o ka yi ma te, Aburamu e yi ɛmɛ wepo, uwu kwonze akwu umɛ uwu oko unye, uwopo ba akwu umɛ uwu oko uwu bɔkɔ akwu unye mo. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Umɛ uwu Aburamu uwu oko unye awu, o mba wu mu amasa iyi onzu. Umɛ uwu bɔkɔ oko uwu akwu unye mo awu bɔkɔ a mba le akwu kenzu igyirima unga Ukpo. <verse eid="GAL 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Ɛlɛ lɛɛbi i yi iluma yi tete: Eko mbɔlɛ akwu kenzu igyirima ekpepo unga bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyiri mbala enzu wu. Aga akwu kenzu igyirima ka kpɛnyi unga bɔkɔ o wo mu lɔwa undu Osinayi, uwu gba a mba ɛmɛ umba bɔkɔ o bo kwu enye le. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Aga akwu kyamate lɔwa undu Osinayi mu ɛzhi iyi Arabiya, kwu masa ma mbala Ɔzhɛrusalɛ uwu ɔnɛ te, kwuwongu enzu umba Ɔzhɛrusalɛ lɛɛbi o yi mu rinye. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Ɔzhɛrusalɛ uwu bɔkɔ e yi moshi awu ba e yi rinye mo, kinzu gba ki kwu enzu umba kwuse kwɔngu le. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Moo kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu zɔ te,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">&lt;&lt;Mwɔnyɛ, uŋɔ odogyi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">uŋɔ uwu bɔkɔ ŋɔ mba ɛmɛ mo, ta kpaa kaa loga gbɔrɔrɔ laa ɔnyɛ, uŋɔ uwu bɔkɔ ŋɔ di ma wɔnu umbu kwomba dɛ mo awu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Moo oko uwu bɔkɔ ɔnu wu a luwu afyima awu a ka ɛmɛ riba laa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">oko uwu bɔkɔ ɔnu wu a luwu afyima mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ ɛmɛnɛ mi, lunyi lu yi kyamate Aziki te. Lunyi lu kwu ɛmɛ umba kenzu igyirima. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Kyamate umɛ uwu bɔkɔ o mba wu mekeka iyi amasa iyi onzu e lo umɛ uwu bɔkɔ o mba kwuwongu ɛduma iyi kwundu uwu Ukpo inyashi awu, tatayi gba i yi le kekelele. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Iso iyi Ukpo ba i zɔ te? I zɔ te &lt;&lt;Ra la oko unye awu ma mbala umɛ wu, kwuwongu umɛ uwu oko unye awu e ri ogu uwu ete wu mbala umɛ uwu oko uwu bɔkɔ akwu unye mo awu mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ ɛmɛnɛ mi, ki kwu ɛmɛ umba oko uwu bɔkɔ akwu unye awu mo. Ki kwu ɛmɛ umba oko uwu bɔkɔ akwu unye mo le.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s">Lalu Nyama Kaa Lalu Kwu Enye Fo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Okrasi a wanzu ma mu rinye ingyi ɛrama imbwaluma te ka la ki gba ki kwu enye mba ɛrama fo. Kwuwo kwɔngu la lu rima kpakiri, la lu gba lu shi ɛyi la rinye ingyi ɛrama imbwaluma fo.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Yese! Lalu ngbɛ alu ka lu pwa iso mi, Ɔpɔlu. Gba lu nyama ɔ zɛ yi ɛsɔ ma, i zɔ te lukwu undu Ɔzhizɔsi e kpo kwuwo yi le, akwu shaa. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Imi la mi so yi kpɔ te, onzu uwu a nyama o zɛ wu ɛsɔ ma, mɛga a nyɔlɔ ɛrama iyi bɔkɔ i shi mo awu lɛɛbi. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e to te ɛsɔ izɛma gba i shi Ukpo a na wu le, de ba le yitu te a ka ɛnwu ma mbala Okrasi-e. Lu lafya la esheshi iyi Ukpo o. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Kinzu ba mu ekpasu iyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo, ki yi idu fafa ki rigbo la ototo uwu Ukpo e so e shi mɛzhi te ee shi nzu ɔnuwu kwɔnyi kwɔlɛ. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Kinzu wa mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, la ɛsɔ izɛma, la kworiyo akwu kiya kinyinyi meka nzu mo. Kiya ingyi o gyi gba akwu ikwu idu lu fulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi iyi bɔkɔ i shi ki pwu idɛnyi iyi esu le.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Lu yi mu Ɔzhizɔsi imbwaluma marimari. Uwe bɔkɔ e kyoro yi mo bɔkɔ lu lafya la ɔgwuzɛ ongbulolo imbwaluma ŋa? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o gwu yi ekwu ɛlɛ te awu, i ngyi mba Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ a ya yi ma awu mo. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Lalu lolo te gba o kyo &lt;&lt;Otutu owua bwɛɛ mu umbwu oweyina, oweyina awu e yi mo mbwɔrubwɔru.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Imi mi shi egbo te Ukpo a mbwa yi ma ka la lu mbwalu iso ɛwa mo. Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e ye yi mu egbo iwo gɛrɛgɛrɛ awu ba, a ma kwuwo ungwu Ukpo.<verse eid="GAL 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, gba anu iyi mi yi mu itama le akwiyi te lo zɛ ɛsɔ ma le, ba kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ Azhu o ye mi mu inyashi ilomo? Gba li yi tayi, ifate anu itama iyi lukwu ndu Okrasi mu kwuwɛyi ka la sa enzu ma lakwu ɛrama ifomo fo lo. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Mi lɛ Ukpo te enzu umba bɔkɔ o ye yi mu egbo ifomo ele, lo zɛ mba ɛsɔ ma akwɛyi lo kyo lo lu api mba ma tete!<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi wa mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi, Ukpo a ya yi ma te ka la lu yi ɔsɛkɛnɛ. Lunyi ba la lu ra la ɔsɛkɛnɛ uwu Ukpo e shi yi ele, ka lu wo apula iyira mo. Lalu gyi esu, la lu mbwa la esu mo. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Ɛrama lɛɛbi o ngbɛyi lesu akwu ikpɛnyi te: &lt;&lt; Pwu idɛnyi iyi onzu u nɔ a kpa ŋa kyamate ŋɔ pwu iyi ɛŋɔ tayi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Lunyi ba la lu ngbɛndu kaa lu tutu esu mo mu itumo mbala esu ikyɛma mo.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwundu Uwu Ukpo Mbala Iyimo iyi Onzu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Iyi mi yi mu isomo gba akwu te, gba lu ra la ɛnwu yi lu shi Kwundu, Ukpo a mbwa yi ma akwɛyi lu wo apula iyira mo. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ɛnwu iyi onzu i gyi, akwu ingyi gba Kwundu uwu Ukpo ba a gyi le mo. Kwundu uwu Ukpo mbala ɛnwu, i to ewa mbala esu iyɔkpɔɔ akwɛyi i shi ŋɔ te wo kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ gyi mo. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Gba lu mbwalu iyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo e so yi, lu ŋɔ la ɛrama i yi omosisi fo.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Apula iyira iyi ɛnwu i wo, i zɔ gedegede, iyi gba akwu: iyama, apula iyi kashi iwomo, mbala ɛrara iwomo, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />eshi ibyima mbala wɔyɛ, igyi esu mo, ovyo itama, rise, amba umbira, igyi ɛŋɔ, enzu ikama <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />mbala anya iwomo; atɛ iwomo, mbala ɛrara iyinayina lɛɛbi. Imi mi tu yi mo dɛ-ɛ, tetete mi gba mi so yi kpɔ te, enzu umba bɔkɔ o wo apula ɛlɛ te lɛɛbi, o kyo mu ɛsu irimo iyi Ukpo mo.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Kwundu uwu Ukpo ba ekoko a zɔ: idɛnyi, ɔnyɛ , idu igbomo, idu iyi mo, ari iyeshi, e wo iyeshi, enzu o fulo idu ma wu, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />e yi egbo mɛzhi mbala ɛnwu iyimo. Ɛrama iyi bɔkɔ i nyi ma te lo wo apula ɛlɛ mo, i yi mo. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu umba Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi ba o nyama ka ɛnwu iyi ingbomo ɛlɛ, li to mbo keyi mo. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Kinzu ba kwuwongu Kwundu uwu Ukpo gba e shi nzu kwunyɔ le awu, la ki zɛ luzɛ undu lu she la Kwundu. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />La ki zhi esu ma mo, la ki wo rise ingyi esu mo, ba la ki wo ovyo mbala esu mo.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s">Lalu Mbwama La Esu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, akwiyi o yi onzu mo mu ingbomo, lunyi umba bɔkɔ lu yi mu luzɛ mu kwundu awu, la lu gba wu bo mɔguzɛ zezeze. Lunyi ba la lu ngbɛndu, kaa lo mondo yi mo tete mo. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Lalu mbwa la esu ma kwuyengwu bɔkɔ onzu uwufo yi e yi mu inyashi imama, moo mu iwomo ɛlɛ gba lu nyɔlɔ ɛrama iyi Okrasi mo le. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e to ɛnwu te akwu kiya, uwu ba akwu kiya kikpikpɛnyi mo, e kyoro ɛnwu wu ma. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Onzonzu le yese luzɛ wu ma kaa la ma, gba luzɛ wu lu shoshi uwu mafyi wu a mwɔnyɛ, akwɛyi a manda luzɛ wu mbala luzɛ undu onzu uwufo shaa mo <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />moo onzonzu e shi ewulo iya wu.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ o zɔ wu iso iyi Ukpo, i shoshi te le to kiya ingyi esheshi kaa le shi onzu uwu a zɔ wu awu.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Lalu kyoro ɛnwu yi ma mo, o wo Ukpo ɛnɛ mo. Kiya ingyi onzu e so le gba a lɔ le. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e so mu ɛnwu a lɔ ira, onzu uwu ba e wo kiya ingyi ki she laa kwundu, a fya kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔɔ. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Ɛnwu li kwunzu mo mu iyeshi iwomo mo, gba ki gyakpɔɔ mu iyeshi iwomo gba kwuye kwu bo ki lɔ ki nyɔ mogba. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ, gba lu fya kapa la lu wo iyeshi la enzu lɛɛbi, iyi wa mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi ba li ka le.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iso Imbwambwa Mbala Ɛnyi Igbɛlɛma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Lalu yese ɛzu iyɛku iyi bɔkɔ Imi mi ka mafyi mi mu kwupwu kwɔlɛ kaa lo kayi! <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpa yi mɛga te la lu zɛ ɛsɔ ma awu, akwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o gyi te lo ma mba te umba gba o shoshi le. O wo ɛlɛ kaa lo lo mbo inyashi kwuwongu lukwu undu Okrasi mo. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o zɛ ɛsɔ ma lala o mbwalu ɛrama mo, umba ba o gyite lo zɛ yi ɛsɔ ma kaa umba lo zɔ kenzu ma yi lɛɛbi. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Ukpo le se ɔgwuzɛ ma kaa la mi zɔ kenzu, kenzu izɔma mi la kwu mekeka iyi lukwu undu Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. Kwuwongwu lukwu wu, kwudu kwɔlɛ kwu she mi fo, imi ba mi she la kwudu kwɔlɛ fo tete. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Laa ɛsɔ izɛma laa kworiyo akwu kiya kinyinyi mo: I gba la onzu imbama iyepo mu Okrasi gba akwu kiya le. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o mbwalu uwulu ɔlɛ, idigbomo iyi Ukpo mbala eyembembyi wu li yi mbala mba lɛɛbi.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Mu imbwama yi, mi gyi te onzu uwunawuna le wo mi egbo gidigidi fo, moo eto iyi bɔkɔ i yi mɛnwu mi le, i zɔ te mi kwu uwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi esheshi iyi Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi li yi mbala yi lɛɛbi. Li yi tayi.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>